{"seq":3,"slug":"withdrawal-flow","title":"提现申请/审核/打款","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/realtime-merchant-settlement/escrow-available-balance/withdrawal-flow","wordCount":2128,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"提现申请-审核-打款\">提现申请/审核/打款</h1><p>余额从 <code>available</code> 变成商家银行卡里的钱，要经过三段：申请受理、审核、打款。这三段是资金真正离开平台的唯一通道，因此也是全 hub 资损防线最密集的地方。本文讲每一段的正确实现方式，以及贯穿三段的幂等与对账要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三段式与状态机\">核心概念：三段式与状态机</h2><p><strong>把提现建模为一条单向状态机，所有状态迁移都必须幂等、可追溯、可中断恢复。</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; REQUESTED: 商家提交申请&#10;    REQUESTED --&gt; RESERVED: 受理成功(available-&gt;reserved)&#10;    REQUESTED --&gt; REJECTED: 校验不通过&#10;    RESERVED --&gt; REVIEWING: 进入人工审核&#10;    REVIEWING --&gt; APPROVED: 审核通过&#10;    REVIEWING --&gt; REJECTED: 审核拒绝&#10;    APPROVED --&gt; PAYING: 提交代付通道&#10;    PAYING --&gt; PAID: 通道回执成功&#10;    PAYING --&gt; PAY_FAILED: 通道回执失败/超时&#10;    PAY_FAILED --&gt; PAYING: 重试(条件:可重试错误)&#10;    PAY_FAILED --&gt; ROLLBACK: 重试耗尽&#10;    REJECTED --&gt; [*]&#10;    ROLLBACK --&gt; [*]: reserved-&gt;available&#10;    PAID --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; REQUESTED: 商家提交申请\n    REQUESTED --&gt; RESERVED: 受理成功(available-&gt;reserved)\n    REQUESTED --&gt; REJECTED: 校验不通过\n    RESERVED --&gt; REVIEWING: 进入人工审核\n    REVIEWING --&gt; APPROVED: 审核通过\n    REVIEWING --&gt; REJECTED: 审核拒绝\n    APPROVED --&gt; PAYING: 提交代付通道\n    PAYING --&gt; PAID: 通道回执成功\n    PAYING --&gt; PAY_FAILED: 通道回执失败/超时\n    PAY_FAILED --&gt; PAYING: 重试(条件:可重试错误)\n    PAY_FAILED --&gt; ROLLBACK: 重试耗尽\n    REJECTED --&gt; [*]\n    ROLLBACK --&gt; [*]: reserved-&gt;available\n    PAID --&gt; [*]</pre><p>三段各自的职责边界必须清晰，否则会出现「审核时改了金额但预留的还是旧金额」这类不一致。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>段</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>关键幂等键</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>申请受理</td>\n<td>商家请求（金额、收款账户）</td>\n<td>预留成功/失败</td>\n<td><code>withdrawalId</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审核</td>\n<td>已预留的申请</td>\n<td>通过/拒绝 + 审核意见</td>\n<td><code>withdrawalId</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>打款</td>\n<td>已通过的申请</td>\n<td>通道回执</td>\n<td><code>withdrawalId</code> + 通道流水号</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>审核段不能修改金额。</strong> 如果需要调整，正确做法是拒绝原申请、由商家重新提交。允许审核改金额会让「预留金额」与「实际打款金额」脱钩，而这个脱钩在打款失败回滚时会导致余额错位——回滚的是预留时的金额，打出去的又是另一个金额，差额凭空产生或消失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"申请受理-校验清单\">申请受理：校验清单</h2><p>受理阶段的每一次校验都对应一类真实的资损或投诉场景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface WithdrawalRequest {&#10;  merchantId: string;&#10;  amountMinor: number;&#10;  currency: string;&#10;  payoutAccountId: string;&#10;  idemKey: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const CHECKS = [&#10;  &#39;amount &gt; 0&#39;,&#10;  &#39;amount % 100 === 0 或满足通道最小单位&#39;,&#10;  &#39;amount &gt;= 通道最小提现额(minPayoutMinor)&#39;,&#10;  &#39;amount &lt;= 通道单笔最大额(maxPayoutMinor)&#39;,&#10;  &#39;amount &lt;= available 余额&#39;,&#10;  &#39;payoutAccount 属于该 merchantId 且已验证&#39;,&#10;  &#39;merchant 的 KYC/KYB 状态为 VERIFIED&#39;,&#10;  &#39;merchant 未被禁止提现(冻结/风控/欠款)&#39;,&#10;  &#39;收款账户与商户主体一致性(同名或已备案)&#39;,&#10;  &#39;该商户当日提现次数与总额未超限&#39;,&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WithdrawalRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  merchantId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  amountMinor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  payoutAccountId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  idemKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> CHECKS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'amount > 0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'amount % 100 === 0 或满足通道最小单位'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'amount >= 通道最小提现额(minPayoutMinor)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'amount &#x3C;= 通道单笔最大额(maxPayoutMinor)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'amount &#x3C;= available 余额'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'payoutAccount 属于该 merchantId 且已验证'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'merchant 的 KYC/KYB 状态为 VERIFIED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'merchant 未被禁止提现(冻结/风控/欠款)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '收款账户与商户主体一致性(同名或已备案)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '该商户当日提现次数与总额未超限'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个值得单独说明的校验。</p>\n<p><strong>「收款账户属于该商家」是最容易被绕过的一条，也是反洗钱的核心。</strong> 如果允许提现到任意账户，平台就成了洗钱通道——A 商家的脏钱提到 B 的账户。业界的标准做法是<strong>收款账户白名单 + 主体一致性校验</strong>：账户必须由商家在后台添加并经过验证（小额打款验证或银行账户证明），且账户名与商家法定主体名一致，或者已在平台完成代收代付备案。变更收款账户必须重新验证并通常触发<strong>提现冻结期</strong>（例如 24–72 小时），这是针对账号被盗后立刻改收款账户提款的攻击的标准防线。</p>\n<p><strong>「通道单笔最大额」是分布式拒绝服务式的资损点。</strong> 代付通道通常有单笔上限（如单笔 5 万）与单日累计上限。如果系统不感知这些限制，一次大额提现会被通道拒绝，而本地已标记为 <code>PAYING</code>——状态不一致。<strong>通道限额必须作为配置进入受理校验</strong>，而不是等通道报错。</p>\n<p><strong>「amount % 100」这类最小单位约束来自通道而非平台。</strong> 某些银行代付通道要求金额是 1 元的整数倍，某些允许到分。忽略这一条会导致大量「打款失败但余额已预留」的垃圾记录。</p>\n<p>受理成功的原子动作是<strong>预留</strong>：<code>available → reserved</code> 的余额迁移加一条状态迁移，在同一事务内完成。这里必须持有账户锁并检查余额，理由与<a href=\"pending-available-balance\">在途/可提现/冻结余额</a>里讲的并发提现问题相同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"审核-规则引擎加人工\">审核：规则引擎加人工</h2><p>审核段的设计目标是<strong>让 90% 以上的提现自动通过，把人工审核集中到真正有风险的少数</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>金额 ≤ 自动通过阈值，且商家历史无异常</td>\n<td>自动通过</td>\n<td>数量最大，风险最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次提现</td>\n<td>人工审核</td>\n<td>无历史数据可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收款账户最近 72 小时内变更</td>\n<td>人工审核 + 冻结期</td>\n<td>账号盗用攻击的标准模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金额 &gt; 阈值</td>\n<td>人工审核</td>\n<td>单笔损失上限控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商家近期退款率 / 拒付率异常升高</td>\n<td>人工审核</td>\n<td>预判坏账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商家处于违规调查中</td>\n<td>拒绝</td>\n<td>见<a href=\"../fund-safety/freeze-deduction\">违规冻结/划扣/保证金</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>审核必须留痕</strong>：审核人、审核时间、通过/拒绝理由、当时看到的余额与风险指标快照。留痕不只是合规要求，它在商家申诉时需要作为证据。<strong>拒绝必须有可读的理由</strong>，且理由要能直接给商家看——「拒绝」两个字会引发大量客服工单。</p>\n<p>审核通过之后的动作是<strong>生成打款指令（payout instruction）</strong>，它应该是一个不可变对象：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PayoutInstruction {&#10;  instructionId: string;&#10;  withdrawalId: string;&#10;  channel: string;&#10;  amountMinor: number;&#10;  currency: string;&#10;  beneficiary: {&#10;    accountName: string;&#10;    accountNumber: string;&#10;    bankCode: string;&#10;    country: string;&#10;  };&#10;  reference: string;&#10;  attempts: PayoutAttempt[];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PayoutInstruction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  instructionId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  withdrawalId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  channel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  amountMinor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  beneficiary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    accountName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    accountNumber</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    bankCode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    country</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  reference</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  attempts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PayoutAttempt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>beneficiary</code> 必须<strong>在受理时快照</strong>，而不是打款时再查商家当前的收款账户。否则「审核时账户是 A、打款时账户已改成 B」的场景会让审核形同虚设——审核的是 A，打款到 B。这个快照是不可变对象存在的核心理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"打款-通道回执与超时的正确解读\">打款：通道回执与超时的正确解读</h2><p>打款是整个流程里唯一与外部系统交互、且<strong>结果可能未知</strong>的一段。</p>\n<p><strong>超时不等于失败。</strong> 代付通道调用超时意味着「不知道钱有没有出去」，此时绝不能重试，也不能标记失败——正确做法是进入<strong>查询态</strong>：调用通道的查询接口确认结果，或等待通道的异步回调。这是分布式事务的经典问题，在资金场景里的后果是重复打款（真金白银的损失）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function payPayout(instruction: PayoutInstruction): Promise&lt;PayoutResult&gt; {&#10;  const existing = instruction.attempts.find((a) =&gt; a.status === &#39;SUCCESS&#39;);&#10;  if (existing) return { status: &#39;PAID&#39;, channelTxnId: existing.channelTxnId };&#10;&#10;  const inFlight = instruction.attempts.find((a) =&gt; a.status === &#39;SENT&#39; &amp;&amp; now() - a.sentAt &lt; QUERY_GRACE_MS);&#10;  if (inFlight) return { status: &#39;UNKNOWN&#39;, attemptId: inFlight.attemptId };&#10;&#10;  const stale = instruction.attempts.find((a) =&gt; a.status === &#39;SENT&#39; &amp;&amp; now() - a.sentAt &gt;= QUERY_GRACE_MS);&#10;  if (stale) {&#10;    const queried = await channel.query(stale.channelTxnId);&#10;    if (queried.status === &#39;SUCCESS&#39;) return { status: &#39;PAID&#39;, channelTxnId: stale.channelTxnId };&#10;    if (queried.status === &#39;FAILED&#39;) return retryOrRollback(instruction, stale);&#10;    return { status: &#39;UNKNOWN&#39;, attemptId: stale.attemptId };&#10;  }&#10;  return sendNewAttempt(instruction);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> payPayout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">instruction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PayoutInstruction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PayoutResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> existing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instruction.attempts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SUCCESS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (existing) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PAID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, channelTxnId: existing.channelTxnId };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> inFlight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instruction.attempts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SENT'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.sentAt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> QUERY_GRACE_MS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (inFlight) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UNKNOWN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, attemptId: inFlight.attemptId };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instruction.attempts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SENT'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.sentAt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> QUERY_GRACE_MS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stale) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> queried</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(stale.channelTxnId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (queried.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'SUCCESS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PAID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, channelTxnId: stale.channelTxnId };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (queried.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FAILED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> retryOrRollback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(instruction, stale);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UNKNOWN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, attemptId: stale.attemptId };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sendNewAttempt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(instruction);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个关键点。</p>\n<p><strong>其一，<code>idemKey</code> 必须随请求发给通道。</strong> 主流代付通道支持幂等键（如 Stripe 的 <code>Idempotency-Key</code>、多数银行代付的商户流水号）。用 <code>withdrawalId</code> 作为该键，通道侧就能帮你去重。<strong>不传幂等键而在超时后重试，是重复打款的头号原因。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>其二，<code>QUERY_GRACE_MS</code> 是一个必须显式设置的参数。</strong> 它太短会让查询量爆炸，太长会让提现卡住。合理值通常是几秒到一分钟，且应该按通道配置。</p>\n<p><strong>其三，重试次数必须有上限，且耗尽后必须回滚预留。</strong> 无限重试会在通道故障时堆积巨量的进行中打款，而这些打款有一部分可能已经成功。<strong>回滚前必须做一次终态查询</strong>——这是唯一能确认「钱没出去」的动作。</p>\n<p><strong>打款失败回滚时，<code>reserved → available</code> 的迁移必须与打款指令的终态在同一事务里确定。</strong> 否则可能发生「已回滚但通道后来又成功打款」的双重支付。做法是把回滚动作也做成状态机迁移（<code>PAY_FAILED → ROLLBACK</code>），由唯一约束保证幂等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"打款对账-与银行流水勾稽\">打款对账：与银行流水勾稽</h2><p>提现链条的最终验证来自<strong>银行对账单</strong>，而不是通道的返回码。</p>\n<p>平台记录的 <code>PAID</code> 是「通道说成功了」，而银行对账单上的记录是「钱真的到了收款人账上」。两者之间还隔着通道内部的清算，因此必须有一个独立的对账任务：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>拉取银行/通道的付款明细文件（通常是 T+1 的日终文件）。</li>\n<li>按 <code>channelTxnId</code> 或 <code>商户流水号</code> 与平台记录做匹配。</li>\n<li>平台 <code>PAID</code> 但银行无记录 → 通道虚报，需要向通道追查（少见但真实存在）。</li>\n<li>银行有记录但平台无 <code>PAID</code> → 平台漏记，必须补记否则商家余额虚高。</li>\n<li>金额/收款账户不一致 → <strong>最严重的一类</strong>，需要立即人工介入，可能是被篡改。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这第三类差异是<a href=\"../realtime-vs-batch/realtime-batch-reconcile\">实时分账与日终批量对账勾稽</a>讲的通用勾稽手法在提现场景的具体应用，差异分类与修复流程见<a href=\"../realtime-vs-batch/split-discrepancy\">分账差异检测与修复</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>提现是三段单向状态机</strong>：受理（<code>available → reserved</code>）、审核、打款；状态迁移必须幂等可恢复。</li>\n<li><strong>审核不能改金额</strong>——改金额会让预留与实际打款脱钩；需要调整就拒绝后重新申请。</li>\n<li><strong>受理校验清单里三条最关键</strong>：收款账户归属与主体一致性、通道单笔/单日限额、金额最小单位；收款账户变更必须重新验证并触发冻结期。</li>\n<li><strong><code>beneficiary</code> 必须在受理时快照</strong>，否则「审核 A、打款到 B」会让审核失效。</li>\n<li><strong>打款超时不是失败</strong>：进入查询态，凭通道幂等键去重，<code>QUERY_GRACE_MS</code> 后主动查询，重试次数耗尽才回滚，<strong>回滚前必须做终态查询</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>最终验证来自银行对账单</strong>，不是通道返回码；金额或收款账户不一致属于最高危差异，必须立即人工介入。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>钱出了平台之后，还要跟渠道和银行的账对上——这就是下一章的主题，从<a href=\"../realtime-vs-batch/realtime-batch-reconcile\">实时分账与日终批量对账勾稽</a>开始。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"提现申请/审核/打款","id":"提现申请-审核-打款"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三段式与状态机","id":"核心概念-三段式与状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"申请受理：校验清单","id":"申请受理-校验清单"},{"level":2,"text":"审核：规则引擎加人工","id":"审核-规则引擎加人工"},{"level":2,"text":"打款：通道回执与超时的正确解读","id":"打款-通道回执与超时的正确解读"},{"level":2,"text":"打款对账：与银行流水勾稽","id":"打款对账-与银行流水勾稽"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"确认收货/售后期满释放规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/realtime-merchant-settlement/escrow-available-balance/settlement-release-rule"},"next":{"title":"实时分账与日终批量对账勾稽","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/realtime-merchant-settlement/realtime-vs-batch/realtime-batch-reconcile"}}